*.log
build_log.txt

# Python screen-design mockups — reference material, deliberately untracked
simrad-mockup/
simrad-nav-mockup/
__pycache__/

# Root-level debug screenshots / session notes / UI dumps (app res + icon PNGs stay tracked)
/*.png
/state*.md
/ui.xml
